OL,3,AReform Wales leader backs Senedd member
OL,4,Awho said white people being replaced
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform's leader in Wales says she
OL,7,Fstands "firmly" by one of her Senedd
OL,8,Fmembers who was banned from speaking in
OL,9,Fthe parliament for claiming white
OL,10,Fpeople are being "replaced" in the UK.
OL,12,FHelen Jenner said Members of the Senedd
OL,13,F(MSs) should not be "silenced" after
OL,14,FJoe Martin was told he would not be
OL,15,Fallowed to speak in the chamber until
OL,16,Fhe apologised.
OL,18,FOn Tuesday the Senedd's Presiding
OL,19,FOfficer Huw Irranca-Davies said
OL,20,FMartin's remarks were "unnecessarily
OL,21,Fprovocative and deliberately
OL,22,Foffensive".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
