OL,3,AReform Wales leader backs Senedd member
OL,4,Awho said white people being replaced
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement on social media on
OL,7,FWednesday, Jenner said: "Whatever your
OL,8,Fpolitical views, nobody elected to the
OL,9,FSenedd should be silenced simply
OL,10,Fbecause others disagree with what they
OL,11,Fhave to say."
